Third-party libraries bundled in binary distributions
-----------------------------------------------------

Binary distributions (for example the shaded classes inside argos-agent.jar
and the libraries in the server package) include third-party libraries. Their
names, versions, licenses, copyright notices and NOTICE texts are listed in the
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES file generated by the build and shipped with each artifact
(META-INF/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES inside argos-agent.jar, licenses/ in the server
package).
